      "created_at": "2015-06-28T23:44:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The minions would have been harder to take out so it could have had an impact on how much damage could have been directed at Voss. &nbsp;The first crowbar hit from Mr Fixer would have needed to hit Voss first to make sure the minion went down depending upon what he had out for a Style. &nbsp;With a slight extension of the game a ship or detrimental environment card could have come out like Claustrophic Delsuion forcing him to flip Voss if he wanted to damage him. &nbsp;</p>",
